S.value:Lot_Number::STRING AS Lot_Number, LISTITEMS.value:PackName::STRING AS PackName, LISTITEMS.value:Quantity::NUMBER AS Item_Quantity, LISTITEMS.value:Rate::NUMBER AS Item_Rate, LISTITEMS.value:Tax_Amt_1::NUMBER AS Tax_Amt_1, LISTITEMS.value:Tax_Amt_3::NUMBER AS Tax_Amt_3, LISTITEMS.value:Tax_P_1::NUMBER AS Tax_P_1, LISTITEMS.value:Tax_P_2::NUMBER AS Tax_P_2, LISTITEMS.value:Tax_P_3::NUMBER AS Tax_P_3 FROM snitch_db.maplemonk.logicstream_get_stock_transfer_in, LATERAL FLATTEN(INPUT => LISTITEMS) AS LISTITEMS;",
